### Get all cars
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars


### Get car by ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars/1


### Create a new car
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "make": "Ford",
  "model": "Mustang",
  "year": 2022
}


### Update existing car
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cars/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "make": "Tesla",
    "model": "Model 3 Performance",
    "year": 2026
}